Characterizing and mitigating coherent errors in a trapped
ion quantum processor using hidden inverses

arXiv:2205.14225v2 [quant-ph] 8 May 2023

Swarnadeep Majumder1,2 , Christopher G. Yale3 , Titus Morris4 , Daniel S. Lobser3 , Ashlyn D. Burch3 ,
Matthew N. H. Chow3,5,6 , Melissa C. Revelle3 , Susan M. Clark3 , and Raphael C. Pooser4
